+/* Cast can publish primary IDLE with extended LOADING while an attributed
+ * first load is still starting. requestId is not a state signal once the
+ * session is bound, but a terminal idleReason always wins. Keep this bounded
+ * to the pre-play Loading/Buffering phase so a later IDLE cannot resurrect an
